<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="ded22e48">&lt;p&gt;
    Be sure to validate, preferably through in-person workshops, in order to gain consensus amongst all appropriate
    stakeholders before finalizing. The resulting documentation should be created with the larger target audience in
    mind.  Roles and responsibilities to maintain the document should also be determined.   
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="667529c6"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="3a414c38"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="8df95f04">&lt;p&gt;
    The structure, contents and detail of the document will vary depending on project scope and client requirements;
    however, it should clearly state the organization’s mission, vision, values, strategies, and tactics. Critical
    assumptions (&lt;a class=&quot;elementLink&quot;
    href=&quot;./../../core.bus.concepts.base/guidances/termdefinitions/critical_assumption_E51E0AA9.html&quot;
    guid=&quot;_UAEt4KJ3EeS2LtdMC9QHew&quot;&gt;critical assumption&lt;/a&gt;) and critical success factors (&lt;a class=&quot;elementLink&quot;
    href=&quot;./../../core.bus.concepts.base/guidances/termdefinitions/critical_success_factor_1E15573A.html&quot;
    guid=&quot;_YNnFUKJ3EeS2LtdMC9QHew&quot;&gt;critical success factor (CSF)&lt;/a&gt;) should also be included within the document.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
